# CO-ADMIN-006 — Product Master Functional Completion

Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED**  
Extends: CO-ADMIN-005 Product & Lender Master

## Principles

1. Categories, Groups, and Products are **Master Data** maintained by administrators in the UI.
2. No developer intervention to add a product.
3. Operational dropdowns consume Product Registry (`useProductMasterOptions`) — canonical catalog is fallback only.
4. Product Registry APIs require `ENTERPRISE_PERSISTENCE_MODE=prisma`.

## SSOT

| Concern | Path |
|--------|------|
| Category/Group UI | `/admin/product-library/categories` |
| Product Master UI | `/admin/product-library/master` |
| Admin client | `src/lib/enterprise-product-master/admin-client.ts` |
| Runtime options | `src/lib/enterprise-product-master/options.ts` |
| Canonical seed fallback | `src/constants/enterprise-product-master/` |
| Taxonomy seeds | `src/data/catalyst-one/product-library/product-*-seed.ts` |
| APIs | `/api/product-registry/*` |
| Docs | `docs/co-admin-006/CO-ADMIN-006-PRODUCT-MASTER-COMPLETION-REPORT.md` |

## Forbidden

- Page-specific hard-coded product option lists for Opportunity / Deal / Policy operational selects
- Masking Product Registry errors as a fixed “Failed to query products” without actionable detail
- Deleting a Category/Group that still has children
